  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC - FishNET</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNODC FishNET initiative within the Wildlife Programme will assist vulnerable developing countries combating fisheries crime, including strengthening the criminal justice response to such crime, by improving their capacity against organised crime by building networks, tools, knowledge, legal frameworks and policies. The goal is to enhance developing countries&#x2019; efforts to eradicate poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
